{"unit_id":"cjjchina3088191870-sudo__dsh-plugin-miku-theme#readme-3","repo":"cjjchina3088191870-sudo/dsh-plugin-miku-theme","commit":"a2d5ec9a5de19308ed1eaa77631e67700c10917e","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-miku-theme README · 特色：- 星光舞台、人物立绘与拍立得装饰。\n- 音符、星星、图片、衣服、爱心五种会话图标。\n- 宝石蝴蝶结、青银饰边和立体输入框。\n- 点击欢迎页卡片，将常用提示加入输入框。\n- 自由调整人物、照片和背景浓度。\n- 手机支持左上角按钮与抽屉、左侧纵向图标栏两种导航方式。","source":"extracted","section":"特色"}
{"unit_id":"cjjchina3088191870-sudo__dsh-plugin-miku-theme#readme-4","repo":"cjjchina3088191870-sudo/dsh-plugin-miku-theme","commit":"a2d5ec9a5de19308ed1eaa77631e67700c10917e","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-miku-theme README · 安装：适配 DSH 0.2.2-rc.1。将主题与皮肤管理器一起安装：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:cjjchina3088191870-sudo/dsh-plugin-ekko-skin-manager#main github:cjjchina3088191870-sudo/dsh-plugin-miku-theme#main\n```\n\n重启 DSH 并刷新网页，在 **账号菜单 → 设置 → Ekko 皮肤** 中选择 **初音未来**。\n\n使用其他 profile 时，将命令中的 `web` 替换为对应名称。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"cjjchina3088191870-sudo__dsh-plugin-miku-theme#readme-5","repo":"cjjchina3088191870-sudo/dsh-plugin-miku-theme","commit":"a2d5ec9a5de19308ed1eaa77631e67700c10917e","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-miku-theme README · 手机效果：| 左上角按钮与抽屉 | 左侧纵向图标栏 |\n| --- | --- |\n|  |  |\n\n在 **设置 → Ekko 皮肤 → 手机导航方式** 中切换。两种模式用于竖屏手机，横屏和桌面保持各自的布局。","source":"extracted","section":"手机效果"}
