{"unit_id":"cjjchina3088191870-sudo__dsh-plugin-miku-theme#readme-7","repo":"cjjchina3088191870-sudo/dsh-plugin-miku-theme","commit":"a2d5ec9a5de19308ed1eaa77631e67700c10917e","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-miku-theme README · 停用与卸载：在 **设置 → Ekko 皮肤** 中选择 **原生界面**，即可恢复默认外观。\n\n卸载主题：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-plugin-miku-theme\n```","source":"extracted","section":"停用与卸载"}
